 "sentences": [
  "This animal is known only from eight teeth.",
  "Bharattherium lived in India during the latest Cretaceous period.",
  "Scientists discovered the first fossil back in 1989.",
  "It belongs to the gondwanathere family Sudamericidae.",
  "Researchers named it in 2007 using two different names.",
  "Its high, curved teeth feature special enamel to prevent cracking.",
  "One tooth even has three deep cavities called infundibula."
